<%- include("partials/header", { title }) %>
<section class="card setup-card">
  <p class="eyebrow">One setup step left</p>
  <h1>Connect the existing MySQL database</h1>
  <p>The app is running, but it cannot query your database yet. Add the missing values as Replit Secrets, then restart the app.</p>
  <div class="setup-list">
    <p><strong>Secrets still needed:</strong></p>
    <code><%= dbMessage %></code>
  </div>
  <h2>What to check in your hosting panel</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Use the database host’s public hostname, not <code>127.0.0.1</code>.</li>
    <li>Make sure Remote MySQL access allows this Replit app to connect.</li>
    <li>Confirm the database already contains <code>Qa1_users</code>, <code>Qa1_questions</code>, and <code>Qa1_answers</code>.</li>
  </ol>
  <p class="note">Never paste passwords into chat or into source code. Replit Secrets keeps them out of the project files.</p>
</section>
<%- include("partials/footer") %>